  itemName: Micro Beacon
  itemDescription: A compact deployable emergency beacon combining enemy deterrence,
    environmental protection, and limited medical support. Once deployed, the beacon
    creates a temporary safe zone that repels nearby threats, protects the player
    from hazardous exposure, and restores health while its rapidly draining battery
    remains active.
